## Interface: 20506
## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Production
## Author: Devin
## Version: 2.6.0
## Notes: Spell cooldowns as an RTS production queue: bars that drain toward ready, with an optional completion callout. Also as a strip of icons, or as radial discs: each spell's icon cut round with its cooldown as a ring around it, a spark on the ring's head, the countdown across the face and a glow when it is ready. Commander Party Frames can carry the same queue on its banner in place of the class cooldowns (Party Frames → Header → Production in Header), as a second view alongside this frame.
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Gear_01
## SavedVariables: CommanderProductionDB
## RequiredDeps: Commander_Events

